      "quote": "{+▪Our non-U.S. business may be adversely impacted by the U.S. government being a significant stockholder. Sales outside the U.S. accounted for 70% of our revenue for 2025. Having the U.S. government as a significant stockholder could subject us to additional regulations, obligations or restrictions, such as foreign subsidy laws or otherwise, in other countries.+}",
